BorrowService ..> Borrow
BorrowService ..> Book
CategoryService ..> Category
CategoryService ..> Book
BackupService ..> User
BackupService ..> BackupEnvelope
BackupService ..> PostgresTools
BackupService ..> SecurityState
BackupSecurity ..> AuthService
BackupSecurity ..> User

